      "bbox": [
        409,
        1014,
        1283,
        1058
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(c) to expedite the resolution of labor disputes in the private sector which may endanger the health, safety or welfare of the people of the City;",
      "logprob_stats": {
